["This is likely because earlier we'd treat a delegatecall as call with `expectCall`.

Repro for this would look like this:
```solidity
contract Simple {
    function initialize() public {}
}

contract SimpleProxy {
    function initialize(Simple impl) public {
        address(impl).delegatecall(abi.encodeWithSignature("initialize()"));
    }
}
```"]

